1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Ld",null,{"eyebrow":"Read with confidence","title":"Online Quran Reading Classes","description":"Live one-to-one Quran reading classes for kids and adults who know basic Arabic letters and want to read from the Mushaf with greater accuracy, fluency and confidence.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$Le",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$Lf",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Online Quran Reading Classes"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Move from recognizing letters to reading the Quran"}],[["$","p","Online Quran reading classes help learners turn their knowledge of Arabic letters and basic joining into steady reading from the Mushaf. This stage is often called Nazra or Nazira Quran: the learner reads while looking at the Arabic text, rather than reciting from memory. It is suitable for students who have completed a Qaida foundation or can already recognize letters but still hesitate, lose their place or repeat common mistakes.",{"children":"Online Quran reading classes help learners turn their knowledge of Arabic letters and basic joining into steady reading from the Mushaf. This stage is often called Nazra or Nazira Quran: the learner reads while looking at the Arabic text, rather than reciting from memory. It is suitable for students who have completed a Qaida foundation or can already recognize letters but still hesitate, lose their place or repeat common mistakes."}],["$","p","In a live one-to-one lesson, the learner reads aloud while the tutor listens closely. Correction can focus on the exact word, sound, joining pattern or stopping point that needs attention. The purpose is not simply to finish pages quickly. It is to build enough accuracy and control for the learner to approach new passages with less prompting and greater confidence.",{"children":"In a live one-to-one lesson, the learner reads aloud while the tutor listens closely. Correction can focus on the exact word, sound, joining pattern or stopping point that needs attention. The purpose is not simply to finish pages quickly. It is to build enough accuracy and control for the learner to approach new passages with less prompting and greater confidence."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":[["$","div","Read connected Quranic words and verses with growing fluency",{"className":"outcome-item","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4","key":"dzmm74"}]],"className":"lucide-circle-check"}]," ","Read connected Quranic words and verses with growing fluency"]}],["$","div","Correct recurring pronunciation and joining mistakes",{"className":"outcome-item","children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:2:props:children:props:children:0:props:children:0:4:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-circle-check"}]," ","Correct recurring pronunciation and joining mistakes"]}],["$","div","Recognize common stopping signs and pause more carefully",{"className":"outcome-item","children":["$L10"," ","Recognize common stopping signs and pause more carefully"]}],"$L11"]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19",["$L1a","$L1b"],false,"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21"],"$L22","$L23"]}],"$L24"]}]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
